Lakṣmaṇa leaves Sītā to seek Rāma --- Rāvaṇa seizes interval wearing mendicant garb --- Trees winds and Gōdāvarī still before Rāvaṇa --- Rāvaṇa praises lotus-eyed Sītā in silk --- Rāvaṇa asks lineage purpose and fearlessness alone --- Sītā offers seat water and forest food --- Rāvaṇa fixes mind on seizing Sītā --- Sītā watches forest awaiting Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa